            <ArticleTitle>[Anesthetic management of robot-assisted radical prostatectomy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>56-62</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors have an experience in performing of 700 radical prostatectomies by using of daVinci-robot. The main factors determining parameters of operation and anesthesia are presented in the article. The authors give recommendations for optimization of anesthetic management. The main features of patient preparation for robot-assisted radical prostatectomy, parameters of anesthesia and postoperative management of patients are presented in the article.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
